meego-clock (0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The seconds hand only while the clock is seen: its 1 s timer stops
    while the application is not in front and while mce's
    display_status_ind says the display is off or shows the stand-by
    screen ("off", "lpm"); no wakeup a second behind other windows or in
    a pocket.

 -- Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:45:00 +0100

meego-clock (0.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release: the analog clock with the home city, the alarms list,
    the alarm editor with the two-circle time picker, repeat, snooze and
    alarm tone options, on alarmd and clockd.

